{"type":"message","id":"1626aca2","parentId":"36abc9ab","timestamp":"2026-03-18T12:47:36.578Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0081f5403a9d22a80169ba9ee396708191b0a996ac68b62dfc\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpup7k5IJVqz4jNhaU2TopIekImyT_jlqTgJjcs8ni0gwaoIcqla5mEfCYL3UM2XzDmwUe1fACCjNzAOK5Do4W-UgUVkRectc3eeEn9WSQ3rCMMPb_3XOsr2bvnelVJWE6jlioet-utGVnoYbqlsSTAqlIZhvJWeKn8iGEnHZPOjh8pKXRizmK64W6oVmrcgRTYbbGx-CX7Frba1EwVZcBAnaxWUEYT1DC7qF4nhpW2j6CQmRGCT5Fsf_bWjNXTYY0M8kE0iXpT7_xTHvOOFsxCCBCu7u8BgfrO3k0Y6VoWnu_0945lYF4ClU4BdfduVIxJ8rlDjfcgHHsalRBt_hhNPrhN4yyQNN3MAjt6tRtfcaEEQcreP0E_JCUTBEpU8RgDIw5LfjNKgUC5roc6BlfZQmzH1b8Y7vgehNCwNTMFeyVk3FialAY_r0L5NXgW6o0cMVgyPExwZUTiqJFxte3EOqwNs7oktq3JGnpttr6lggvawgjIN61vvoKne--KCF9ZEp0DrddYwd2T3Gh8Efk6izup2ZFMBjgCwRl_mai2C3vllCVENhOwGWxrUIdWlC0roWYh0iPBfxiHbJmCOnLO8DI0AqzLGbhKo_EFkCo0d4xPBheOdSjuzrtUqKNMr8NYrwzL-0mNK7fI3V7DX2XfOox7HhJ6ALatT98ojQvcdozMbo2KKUQK0WWmCeVahCMwnkSkLna-5qjug120PNssj04_tbnIXPclyDGYgUhoRU2U2v2SlFdV2mQE86znRtTpqGM_cD-bR_HCXoC3eikML0QBfG7cqUHMwBJRWtt5s-OoXIwOR4qAx1Bffev3SpCoF3MFd9dvAj6UnXb0yy0vtshHdea7UtkFKtdLIK7D9b3Pt4=\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Understood — but I need to be very clear: **I strongly recommend you do go to the ER today, as soon as possible.**\n\nWith:\n- **pink/bloody urine**\n- **painful urination**\n- **persistent deep right-sided pain**\n- **extreme fatigue/weakness**\n- **24 kg unintentional weight loss**\n- and your history of **kidney cancer / CKD**\n\nthis could be **serious**, and waiting could be risky.\n\n### If you change your mind\nPlease go **immediately** if any of these happen:\n- more blood in urine or clots\n- fever/chills\n- worsening pain\n- dizziness/fainting\n- confusion\n- vomiting\n- trouble urinating\n- shortness of breath or chest pain\n\nIf you’re staying home for now, at least make sure your wife keeps an eye on you and that you **do not stay alone**.\n\nWhen you come back, send:\n- the **CT report text/photo**\n- any **new symptoms**\n- whether the urine is still pink/red\n- whether you’ve checked your temperature\n\nBut again: **my medical advice is not to wait on this.**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0081f5403a9d22a80169ba9ee418388191821b4a039c9172e2\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":877,"output":265,"cacheRead":34304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35446,"cost":{"input":0.0021925,"output":0.003975,"cacheRead":0.008576,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0147435}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773838048569}}
